    input: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `bfloat16`, `half`, `float32`, `float64`, `int64`, `int32`, `uint8`, `uint16`, `uint32`, `uint64`, `int8`, `int16`, `complex64`, `complex128`, `qint8`, `quint8`, `qint16`, `quint16`, `qint32`.
